{"Header":{"Name":"padi.test.claude-demo","Owner":"Padi, Inc.","Title":"Claude Authoring Demo","Provider":"Announcer","Consumer":"Listener","Description":"A demonstration Profile authored end to end by an AI assistant through the Registry's MCP server, on 31 August 2026 — the §15.1 publication path exercised for the first time. The Provider announces a short message; the Consumer acknowledges receipt.","Website":"https://padi.io/claude-demo","Status":"Deprecated"},"Properties":{"Provider":[{"Name":"message","Mandatory":"yes","Propagate":"yes","Description":"The announcement text, broadcast to every Connection this Capability holds.","Sample":"Hello from the Connection Profile Registry."},{"Name":"language","Mandatory":"no","Propagate":"yes","Description":"BCP 47 language tag of the message.","Sample":"en"}],"Consumer":[{"Name":"acknowledged","Mandatory":"yes","Propagate":"no","Description":"Set true by the Listener on the single Connection that received the message — addressed, not broadcast.","Sample":"true"}]}}